    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Floor Area C. 147 sq m / 1582 sq ft\nFlynn Estate Agents are delighted to introduce Number 66 Castleknock Road to the market for sale. This impressive four-bedroom semi-detached home is ideally positioned on the highly sought-after Castleknock Road and has been extended, upgraded and maintained by the current owners over the years.\n The property offers spacious and well-proportioned accommodation, including a substantial rear extension and a mature private garden. The property has been extended to provide excellent living and entertaining space, while the established evergreen planting to the rear creates a wonderful sense of privacy.\n\n \nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall with access to the family room, lounge and kitchen, together with a downstairs shower room and W.C. The extended kitchen is a particularly impressive space and features a wood-burning stove, while the exceptionally spacious lounge benefits from dual-aspect windows and a further wood-burning stove. Upstairs, there are four generously proportioned bedrooms and a family bathroom.\n\n To the rear, the mature private garden is well screened by established evergreen trees and features a pergola and decking area, providing an ideal setting for outdoor dining and entertaining. To the front, there is off-street parking for two cars.\n\nThe location is excellent, with both Castleknock Village and Blanchardstown Village within easy reach. There are a number of well-regarded primary and secondary schools close by, while the property also benefits from excellent public transport links, including regular bus services and Castleknock Train Station. \n\nNumber 66 Castleknock Road offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious and well-established family home in a highly desirable and convenient location. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 5.09m (16'8\") x 3.53m (11'7\")\nWood-effect laminate flooring, alarm panel\n\nOffice / Play Room - 4.68m (15'4\") x 2.46m (8'1\")\nWood-effect laminate flooring, large picture window\n\nW.C / Shower Room - 2.49m (8'2\") x 1.53m (5'0\")\nFully tiled, w.c, washhand basin, electric shower, large window\n\nLiving Room - 7.23m (23'9\") x 3.54m (11'7\")\nWood-effect laminate flooring, wood burning stove, dual aspect, large picture windows overlooking front and rear gardens\n\nKitchen - 3.8m (12'6\") x 3.79m (12'5\")\nWood-effect laminate flooring, fully fitted kitchen, solid wood counter top, patio access to rear garden, integrated appliances, Velux windows\n\nDining Area - 3.69m (12'1\") x 3.54m (11'7\")\nWood-effect laminate flooring, wood burning stove, acess to garden / side entrance\n\nLanding - 2.5m (8'2\") x 1.29m (4'3\")\nFlooring laid in carpet, hotpress, attic access\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.12m (13'6\") x 3.27m (10'9\")\nSpacious double room overlooking front garden\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.54m (8'4\") x 3.82m (12'6\")\nWood-effect laminate flooring, overlooking front garden\n\nBedroom 3 - 1.98m (6'6\") x 3.81m (12'6\")\nWood-effect laminate flooring, overlooking rear garden\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.01m (9'11\") x 3.27m (10'9\")\nWood-effect laminate flooring, overlooking rear garden\n\nBathroom - 1.61m (5'3\") x 2.77m (9'1\")\nFully tiled, w.c, wash hand basin, bath with shower attachment, matte black heated towel rail\n\n"
      },
